      en: ["The Mau movement demanded 'Samoa mo Samoa' (Samoa for Samoans).", "The 'Black Saturday' incident occurred here in 1929.", "The leader Tupua Tamasese Lealofi III was from this village.", "The site is a symbol of Samoan national pride."],
